you can eat it and watch the show at the same time

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:59.920
Gracie, did you know that George had invited Jack Hellman of Variety and Leo

00:12:00.090 --> 00:12:08.460
guilt from the reporter over here tonight no i'm sure george wouldn't want them here with that bunch

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:13.820
of people you invited well they're very nice people i'm sure they are but i know george is

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:18.770
going to be upset because they just won't fit in with hellman and guilt you want to get in touch

00:12:18.770 --> 00:12:23.680
with them and tell them not to come oh well i'm glad you told me before it was too late i'll take

00:12:23.680 --> 00:12:25.220
care of it right away it's a good idea

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:48.740
the variety? Well, this is Gracie Allen. I'm sorry, but George has decided he doesn't want

00:12:48.740 --> 00:12:57.310
you to come over and see our show tonight. Well, um, we're having some nice people over

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:59.690
and George doesn't think you'd fit in. Goodbye.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.130
where you'll go.

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:07.900
Notice that I'm wearing a glove

00:13:07.900 --> 00:13:09.220
and you probably wonder why.

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.440
I bought some dollar and a half cigars

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:12.580
for those two newspaper men

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:13.440
and I'm smoking one

00:13:13.440 --> 00:13:15.060
