00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:18.890
10 cents worth.

00:13:23.600 --> 00:13:24.900
One new race he's waving to.

00:13:25.690 --> 00:13:27.350
Oh, Mr. Beasley, our postman.

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.370
She knows exactly

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:29.290
